[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603021813","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101283#issuecomment-2603021813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101283","id":2603021813,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bJvX1","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T18:14:03Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T18:14:03Z","body":"I generally prefer having a non-embedded window when I run my game, but on occasion I do use the embedded feature to debug certain aspects. So it'd be nice if the \"Embed Game on Next Play\" options on the Game tab would continue to work. Basically, I think it'd be neat if this were just a switch that says \"remember the user's embedding preferences globally instead of per-project\". It'd basically work like this:\r\n\r\nGame embed global override OFF:\r\n- Embed settings loaded from the project metadata\r\n- Game tab's Embedding Options menu shows checkmarks based on project metadata\r\n- Selecting items in the Game tab's Embedding Options menu saves settings to project metadata\r\n\r\nGame embed global override ON:\r\n- Embed settings loaded from editor settings\r\n- Game tab's Embedding Options menu shows checkmarks based on editor settings\r\n- Selecting items in the Game tab's Embedding Options menu saves settings to editor settings","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603021813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603025538","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101283#issuecomment-2603025538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101283","id":2603025538,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bJwSC","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T18:16:45Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T18:20:46Z","body":"> So it'd be nice if the \"Embed Game on Next Play\" options on the Game tab would continue to work. \r\n\r\nIt will continue to work, the setting is only changing the default state (after opening the project) of the toggle (and prevents saving its state to project metadata if it's not set to \"use project settings\").\r\n\r\nIt's as you describe, except `Selecting items in the Game tab's Embedding Options menu saves settings to editor settings`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603025538/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603099292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101283#issuecomment-2603099292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101283","id":2603099292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bKCSc","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T19:12:41Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T19:12:41Z","body":"Ah, so that code loading the embed settings only happens during editor initialization. I'm fine with this behavior, since you can still change the setting in the Embedding Options and have it take effect next time you hit Play without having to dig through the editor settings.\r\n\r\nIt does leave one potential bug/UX papercut though. Since that menu (and thus the embed mode) is only updated when the editor loads, changing the editor setting won't update the menu. So if you open a new project, go to Editor Settings and disable embedding there, it will still embed the next time you hit Play until you change it in the Embedding Options menu or restart the editor, which could confuse users.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603099292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603313300","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101283#issuecomment-2603313300","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101283","id":2603313300,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bK2iU","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_ur